Package: arrowmetal
Type: Package
Title: Apache Arrow Compute on Apple Silicon GPUs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ArrowMetal", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "noreply@arrowmetal.dev")
Description: An R binding for ArrowMetal, which runs Apache Arrow compute
    kernels on Apple silicon GPUs through Metal. Columns cross between the
    'arrow' R package and the GPU through the Arrow C Data Interface, without
    a copy when the producer's buffers are page aligned. The Swift core ships
    as a separate dynamic library, opened at package load; set ARROWMETAL_LIB
    to point at it.
License: Apache License 2.0
URL: https://github.com/singhpratech/ArrowMetal
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: arrow (>= 14.0.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), bit64, jsonlite, microbenchmark
OS_type: unix
SystemRequirements: macOS on Apple silicon, libArrowMetalC.dylib
Config/testthat/edition: 3
